4
00:02:31.000 --> 00:03:12.000
Brenda hadn't seen Louise, but Brett's call jogged a memory. Earlier that day, Brenda had been driving along a rural stretch near her home in Wakefield, Quebec, when she saw a yellow and white Suzuki sidekick Jeep Jeep parked on the shoulder of the road. It was the same make and model as Louise's car. Brenda made a mental note to check whether it belonged to her friend later on. She had forgotten to do so until Brett's call reminded her. Brett rushed to meet Brenda and they inspected the car together. The license plates confirmed it was Louise's car.

