close to where Louise's car had been found. As well as Ottawa detectives and local police officers from Quebec, Brett Morgan and members of Louisa's family were present. The group spanned out from the area of River Road where Louise's car was parked. There was nothing wrong with the vehicle that might have prompted Louise to abandon it there and its tank was full of petrol. A couple who lived nearby told police they'd noticed the Jeep parked there since Saturday, April 22, the day Louise had left for her trip.

