00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:55.000
It was towed to a nearby garage where an officer would later date a day. us asked it for prints. The area surrounding River Road was densely wooded, and spring rain had made it muddy. Police officers and Louise's loved ones tramped through the cold, scouring the bushes and trees for any trace of Louise. They looked through piles of lumber and felled trees, as well as a nearby ridge that was dotted with boulders and a derelict car. They found nothing.

